<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14826] .NET: Thin client fails to compute hash code for string and array keys</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14826</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;String keys are not supported in BinaryHashCodeUtils. The following code throws &quot;Failed to compute hash code for object&quot; exception:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; server = Ignition.Start();

            &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; client = Ignition.StartClient(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; IgniteClientConfiguration
            {
                Endpoints = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt;[] {&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;127.0.0.1&quot;&lt;/span&gt;},
                EnablePartitionAwareness = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
            });

            &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; cache = client.CreateCache&amp;lt;string, string&amp;gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;c&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);
            cache.Put(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;hello&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;world&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
